                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It is a very simple and well written story. It is definitely one of their games that focuses more on the story and relationships between the characters over being straight up lewd stuff. There is lewd stuff but, to fully enjoy it, you will have to download and install a patch from the developer website which, is really easy to do. I still recommend it though. It is a shame that the writer left because a sequel would have been nice. I also heard that this one didn't sell as well so that could also contribute to no sequel, even if the writer had not left. Still recommend it despite no sequel.",
